"tips":[
{"id":"t001","text":"Check n!restock often, rare seeds can appear at any time."},
{"id":"t002","text":"Plant right after using a sprinkler so the bonus applies."},
{"id":"t003","text":"Fertilizer is used on your next planting, so use it just before you plant."},
{"id":"t004","text":"Harvest during special weather for a mutation chance."},
{"id":"t005","text":"Common seeds are always in stock, so you can never run out of things to plant."},
{"id":"t006","text":"Claim n!daily every day for cash and a free seed."},
{"id":"t007","text":"More plots means more crops, so buy plots early."},
{"id":"t008","text":"Trading seeds is a good way to get ones that are out of stock."},
{"id":"t009","text":"Rarer seeds take longer to grow but are worth far more."},
{"id":"t010","text":"Use n!help followed by a command name to see how it works."},
{"id":"t011","text":"Sell all your crops with n!sell to build cash for better seeds."},
{"id":"t012","text":"A Golden mutation multiplies a crop's value by five."},
{"id":"t013","text":"The Harvest Tool gives a permanent bonus, buy it once and keep it forever."},
{"id":"t014","text":"Check n!garden to see which plots are ready."},
{"id":"t015","text":"Exotic seeds are rare in the shop, so check the restock timer."},
{"id":"t016","text":"Rain makes plants Wet, Frost makes them Chilled, and storms can shock them."},
{"id":"t017","text":"Spend cash on gear that boosts growth when your plots are full."},
{"id":"t018","text":"Compare seed prices with n!seeds before you buy."},
{"id":"t019","text":"The leaderboard refreshes about every five minutes."},
{"id":"t020","text":"Save up for Mythical and Divine seeds, they pay off over time."},
{"id":"t021","text":"Keep a few seeds in stock for trades with friends."},
{"id":"t022","text":"Plan your harvests around the weather timer."},
{"id":"t023","text":"Do not forget to harvest, ready crops wait for you."},
{"id":"t024","text":"Each rarity has its own shop page, try n!seeds legendary."},
{"id":"t025","text":"Friends make the garden more fun, so invite someone to play."}
]
}
